# Outfit head (R18): a cloth hood up over the voxel head: a rounded crown with a soft point hanging at the back, the
# sides falling straight to a wide drape over the shoulders, an open face framed by an accent rim.
# Head frame: the head fills x 1..6, y 2..6, z 2..7 (pivot 3 4 2).
name outfit_hood
grid 5
size 8 10 10
slot hood SwatchMain
slot rim SwatchAccent
box 0 2 2 7 8 8 hood
ellipsoid 3.2 5 7.6 3.6 3 2.2 hood
box 0 0 0 6 10 2 hood
box 0 1 2 6 9 3 hood
beam 0.6 5 8.4 -0.4 5 5.5 0.8 hood
carve box 1 3 2 6 7 7
carve box 5 3 1 8 7 7
carve box 6 0 0 8 10 2
paint box 5 0 0 8 10 10 rim
pivot 3 5 2
